#Real command - extract contaminated contig IDs and filter them out:
for sample in C13stmor E12aigua S14skanF S14skanM S15lulea S15stoEA S15stoLA S15stoMJ S15sunds S15umea; do
    echo "Filtering ${sample}..."

    grep "^C" kraken2_output/${sample}.kraken | \
        awk '($3==9606) || ($3==2) || ($3==1224) || ($3==28216) || ($3==28211) || \
             ($3==1236) || ($3==91347) || ($3==80840) || ($3==356) || ($3==953)' | \
        cut -f2 > /tmp/${sample}_contaminant_ids.txt

    grep ">" accessory_contigs_filtered/${sample}_accessory_contigs.fasta | \
        sed 's/>//' > /tmp/${sample}_all_ids.txt

    grep -v -F -f /tmp/${sample}_contaminant_ids.txt /tmp/${sample}_all_ids.txt \
        > /tmp/${sample}_clean_ids.txt

    /data/programs/samtools-1.9/samtools faidx \
        accessory_contigs_filtered/${sample}_accessory_contigs.fasta \
        -r /tmp/${sample}_clean_ids.txt \
        -o contigs_after_minimap_and_kraken/${sample}_filtered_contigs.fasta

    rm /tmp/${sample}_contaminant_ids.txt \
       /tmp/${sample}_all_ids.txt \
       /tmp/${sample}_clean_ids.txt

    echo "${sample}: done -> contigs_after_minimap_and_kraken/${sample}_filtered_contigs.fasta"
done

echo "All samples filtered. Clean contigs ready for annotation in contigs_after_minimap_and_kraken/"

